// Lost City's own way out of Zanaris, the 377 map's mushroom ring by the Chicken Shrine (Lost City's
// script, from before Fairytale II). EASCape: the other fairy rings come with Fairytale II, which
// isn't on main (stored has them).
[oploc1,fairy_mushroom_ring]
p_walk(loc_coord);
anim(human_fairy_vanish, 0);
p_telejump(0_50_49_1_33);
anim(human_fairy_appear, 0);
p_delay(0);
